 "priority": 3,
 "source_bins": [
  "pause_message.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Yeah, so it got me kinda worried. If there's something on your mind, I'd be more than happy to listen.": "",
  "Ugh, why does he always have to run his mouth like that... <symbol=message_angry2>": "",
  "Is something bothering you, though?": "",
  "Well... I guess you could say that. <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "Maybe I can cheer you up somehow?": "",
  "How about we go out on a date?": "",
  "Is this your way of saying you want to catch up?": "",
  "This is my way of doing your brother a favor (=P) Free of charge, mind you.": "",
  "Oh? I didn't know the Yagami Detective Agency provided escort services too! Lol I'm just kidding.": "",
  "Well, whatever's troubling you can usually be fixed with a little fun and entertainment, don't you think?": "",
  "So you want to distract me, huh.": "",
  "Yup. And if that doesn't work, then we'll find a place to sit down and talk. How does that sound?": "",
  "I guess it wouldn't hurt to talk a bit. <symbol=message_joy2>": "",
  "Awesome. Then let's meet up at Theater Square.": "",
  "Okay! See you then. <symbol=message_happy2>": "",
  "So, did you make plans with Tsukino?": "",
  "Yep, we're all set to hang out.": "",
  "That's what I thought. She seemed oddly cheerful today.": "",
  "Did she now?": "",
  "Yeah. She was even humming to herself... I feel like I haven't seen her in such a good mood in a long time.": "",
  "I see. That's good to hear. I'll try and ask her what's up when I see her.": "",
  "Yeah! Please do. Oh, and also...": "",
  "Use protection, okay!?": "",
  "Dude, shut up.": "",
  "Hahaha, just making sure!": "",
  "Yeah. Of course.": "",
  "Hey, I was just kidding! Don't take that seriously!": "",
  "Good luck with your job search.": "",
  "Let's hang out after our practice interview.": "",
  "No problem at all. Good luck with your job search, okay?": "",
  "Any time. Let's hang out after our practice interview's over, yeah?": "",
  "Thanks for taking me out, Yagami-san! Today was super fun. Oh, and thanks for listening to me yak about my problems.": "",
  "Thanks! Make sure to give me some helpful hints on how to get hired! ;-)": "",
  "Sure! Can't wait!": "",
  "Yagami-san. How was Tsukino?": "",
  "She told me everything.": "",
  "That's a secret.": "",
  "She told me everything... things I'm not allowed to repeat.": "",
  "It's a secret.": "",
  "Hmm. What could it possibly be?": "",
  "...Can I guess?": "",
  "Go for it.": "",
  "She has a crush on someone. And that someone is you!": "",
  "Was I wrong?": "",
  "No, you were right.": "",
  "That's not it at all.": "",
  "Then why didn't you just say so?": "",
  "Then I wonder what it could be...": "",
  "Don't worry, I'll check in with her soon.": "",
  "Yes. Please do.": "",
  "Heyo! Guess what! I decided to do some self-analysis today. Have you ever analyzed yourself, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I have.": "",
  "Never.": "",
  "What do you mean by self-analysis?": "",
  "Basically, you take a look at yourself in the context of preparing for a job interview. Things like your personality, special skills, reason for applying... anything that helps you stand out.": "",
  "Huh. I didn't know people did that.": "",
  "Yeah! Apparently people don't understand themselves as much as they think. So you need some introspection. <symbol=message_joy2>": "",
  "I've done that before. And let me tell you, it was harder to do than I thought.": "",
  "Right!?": "",
  "Nope, not once.": "",
  "Oh, you should sometime! You might be able to find out new things about yourself! <symbol=message_happy2>": "",
  "Hm. Maybe it's worth a shot.": "",
  "Did you find out anything about yourself?": "",
  "Not really. It's hard to come up with the right words, you know? Maybe I'm just a shallow person... <symbol=message_sad2>": "",
  "Nah, everyone is like that.": "",
  "That's not true.": "",
  "Nah, everyone is like that. Even I'd have trouble answering if someone asked me why I became a detective.": "",
  "Even you, Yagami-san!? Gosh, then no wonder I couldn't get anything out of it.": "",
  "That's not true. I think you're just a very unique person with your own way of thinking.": "",
  "You really think so? Haha, well thanks. <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "Though, the more I think about it, the more I'm unsure of what I want to do with my life.": "",
  "Are you gonna be okay?": "",
  "I understand. Sometimes when life weighs too heavy on your mind, your thoughts seem to spiral out of control.": "",
  "So I'm just overthinking it?": "",
  "Probably. Either way, it sounds like all you're doing is giving yourself a headache (=P)": "",
  "Yeah, pretty much! <symbol=message_joy2>": "",
  "Are you gonna be okay going into an interview like that?": "",
  "Probably not... but I'll do my best anyway...": "",
  "Can we do a practice interview like we talked about?": "",
  "Eventually.": "",
  "Let's meet up at Theater Square, then.": "",
  "We can do that... eventually. I'll contact you as soon as I'm free.": "",
  "Gotcha! I'll be waiting, then!": "",
  "Hey... I just wanted to apologize for what you had to go through today...": "",
  "As well as thank you for helping me with my interview! <symbol=message_joy2>": "",
  "I could tell you were serious because you were wearing a suit. I hope it helped.": "",
  "How did I look?": "",
  "You really had it together.": "",
  "Like the suit was wearing you.": "",
  "You looked like someone who had it all together. Definitely someone suited for a kickass job.": "",
  "Really! That's good to hear <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "Good luck on your interview.": "",
  "Yeah! I'll do my very best! <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "Actually, it kind of looked like the suit was wearing you lol": "",
  "Nooooo!! <symbol=message_sad2><symbol=message_sad2>": "",
  "Don't worry. You'll start to own it the more you wear it.": "",
  "Ughhh... I hope so...": "",
  "Yagami-san! So I finally went in for my interview!": "",
  "How'd it go?": "",
  "Well, I did the best I could!": "",
  "Good. I hope you get the job.": "",
  "Yeah. But I'm a little uncertain about something.": "",
  "I'm not sure if it was the right company for me...": "",
  "You don't want to work there?": "",
  "That's common.": "",
  "Do you actually not want to work there?": "",
  "...Maybe. Maybe my desire to work there isn't that strong...": "",
  "That's common. You'll find out it was the right choice after you get in.": "",
  "Is that how it works? But what if I get in and find out there's nothing I want to do...?": "",
  "Find a company that suits your needs, then. Once you've figured out what you want, that is.": "",
  "Yeah. Maybe I haven't analyzed myself enough.": "",
  "So... I got an answer from the company.": "",
  "What did they say?": "",
  "I was rejected...": "",
  "Ah. Sorry to hear that.": "",
  "I wonder what I did wrong... <symbol=message_sad2>": "",
  "Ask her out": "",
  "Ask her later": "",
  "Want to go somewhere and blow off some steam?": "",
  "Huh? Really? Yeah, I think I need that!": "",
  "Then let's meet up at Theater Square.": "",
  "(Maybe now's not a good time to ask.)": "",
  "Ugh. It's like I don't even know who I am anymore! <symbol=message_angry2>": "",
  "(Damn. That's pretty heavy. Maybe I should ask her out later to help her blow off some steam.)": "",
  "Hey I just wanted to say thanks for your advice today.": "",
  "What we talked about really made me think... and I ended up learning a lot about myself. ": "",
  "That's wonderful to hear.": "",
  "Yeah. Now that I have a clearer picture of the future, I'm sure I'll do better when the next chance comes around! <symbol=message_joy2>": "",
  "Yagami-san, I've come to a conclusion...": "",
  "I think I'm gonna try applying for jobs where I can utilize my drawing skills.": "",
  "Sounds like a great idea!": "",
  "There's this web design company I've been following for some time now. I'd like to apply there.": "",
  "That's very bold of you.": "",
  "Hope you don't get turned down.": "",
  "That's very bold of you. I like it!": "",
  "Thanks. I've always wanted to do something like this, you know.": "",
  "Hey, don't say that! <symbol=message_angry2><symbol=message_angry2>": "",
  "Oh, and I appreciate you helping me come to this realization.": "",
  "Me? I didn't do much.": "",
  "Actually, you did. I realized something after hearing your story.": "",
  "Sometimes you just have to stop using your head and follow your heart!": "",
  "I don't know if that's exactly how I'd put it, but yeah. That's the general idea.": "",
  "Good! Because that's my new philosophy on life <symbol=message_onpu> At least for now lol": "",
  "So I submitted my designs to the company today. It feels so weird having my work evaluated... It's like, so corporate! Hope I did okay.": "",
  "Aha, so the moment of truth draws near.": "",
  "Haha, yup. What were you up to today?": "",
  "Working. Running around town, handling requests... the usual.": "",
  "That's good! I bet you get some weird jobs every now and then, huh?": "",
  "Too many, as a matter of fact.": "",
  "Being bored. I pretty much spaced out for most of the day. There just wasn't anything to do.": "",
  "Hehehe. I didn't know you had days like that, Yagami-san. <symbol=message_joy2>": "",
  "When I'm out of work, I do.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. It's Yosuke.": "",
  "Tsukino stopped being her usual self all of a sudden. Did something happen?": "",
  "Oh? You didn't hear?": "",
  "Are you dating her now?": "",
  "No, no. That's not it.": "",
  "Did you... do it with her?": "",
  "But she's been doing a lot of skin care and stuff lately...": "",
  "It's like she's in love mode or something.": "",
  "(I think it's 'cause she's prepping for her interview...)": "",
  "She's still a student, you know. Make sure you wear a rubber.": "",
  "Dude, aren't you supposed to be her brother...?": "",
  "Yagami-san! Good news!": "",
  "I passed the initial screening for that company! <symbol=message_happy2><symbol=message_happy2><symbol=message_happy2>": "",
  "And now they want to talk to me in person!": "",
  "That's amazing!": "",
  "What? Are you serious?": "",
  "You bet I am! <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "That's amazing, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Isn't it?": "",
  "I knew you would pass with flying colors, Tsukino-chan!": "",
  "It's like a dream come true!! I can hardly believe it even now...": "",
  "They responded pretty fast, huh?": "",
  "I asked HR about that, and they told me that someone there saw my illustrations and said they wanted to talk to me without even looking at my profile.": "",
  "Wow. I guess your drawings really do make a giant impact... hehe.": "",
  "That's not funny, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hmm... What if they get disappointed after meeting me in person...?<symbol=message_sad2>": "",
  "You'll be fine as long as you prepare.": "",
  "Yeah. I should do that, huh.": "",
  "Ask if she'd like to practice": "",
  "Don't ask her just yet": "",
  "(Maybe I'll help her out with her interview as soon as I find the time.)": "",
  "Well, let's keep in touch, yes?": "",
  "Okay! I'll be waiting!": "",
  "You want me to help you again?": "",
  "Okay. Then I'll see you at Theater Square as usual.": "",
  "Okay! Thank you so much! <symbol=message_happy2>": "",
  "Thanks for your help today, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I just got back from my interview.": "",
  "Congrats on getting it over with.": "",
  "Congrats on getting over with. You deserve some rest.": "",
  "How did your interview go?": "",
  "Of course, I was nervous at first, but I think I really hit it off with the interviewer by the end! <symbol=message_joy2>": "",
  "Yeah. <symbol=message_happy2> As soon as started talking about drawings and anime, the conversation just kept flowing.": "",
  "I probably should've been more serious, but it was because I felt really comfortable. I even laughed a couple times. <symbol=message_onpu>": "",
  "I hope I was okay... <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "But you clearly communicated your expectations, right?": "",
  "I think I did. <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "Then you'll just have to wait and see what they say.": "",
  "I haven't heard anything back yet.": "",
  "Don't dwell too much on it. You'll be fine.": "",
  "Maybe they picked someone else?": "",
  "Don't dwell too much on it. Worrying won't change anything, you know?": "",
  "That's true. I can think of what to do next after they reject me <symbol=message_sad2>": "",
  "Well. There's no point getting depressed, is what I'm trying to say.": "",
  "Yeah! You're right.": "",
  "Ahh... Now I'm even more worried <symbol=message_sad2>": "",
  "They contacted me so quickly last time, too... <symbol=message_ase>": "",
  "Be patient. They'll get in touch with you eventually.": "",
  "Yeah... <symbol=message_sad2>": "",
  "Yagami-san. I got a call from the company.": "",
  "They hired me!!! I'm in!!! <symbol=message_happy2><symbol=message_happy2><symbol=message_happy2>": "",
  "Oh, congratulations!": "",
  "But... I'll be working as a contractor for a year until I become a full-time employee. <symbol=message_ase> Apparently that's how everyone starts off.": "",
  "Okay. And are you going through with it?": "",
  "...I'm honestly a little hesitant, but I think I'll be okay in the end. It seems like I'll get the chance to be a full-timer as soon as they acknowledge my work.": "",
  "So I'll give it my very best shot!": "",
  "I'm proud of you, Tsukino-chan. You finally got where you wanted to be. I'm sure you'll do great.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I have something important to tell you. Can I borrow some of your time?": "",
  "Maybe later?": "",
  "Then can I go to your office tonight?": "",
  "That's fine.": "",
  "Then I'll see you tonight!": "",
  "Sorry, but now's not exactly the best time. Can I get in touch with you later?": "",
  "Yeah, that's not a problem! I'll be waiting!": "",
  "Hey, remember that outfit I bought you? This might be a good opportunity to try it out, right?": "",
  "Hmm.": "",
  "It's a bit much, but you're right. Now's as good a time as any!": "",
  "(Score!)": "",
  "Forget it": "",
  "(Should I ask Tsukino-chan out on a date?)": "",
  "(Nah. Now's not a good time.)": "",
  "(Okay. Let's see what she says.)": "",
  "Hey, Tsukino-chan. If you're free right now, you wanna go out somewhere?": "",
  "Sure! I was actually just thinking about you! <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "Great, then let's meet up at Theater Square.": "",
  "Okay! Be right there!": "",
  "(Oh yeah. I should get something for Tsukino-chan before our date. Maybe some kind of present?)": "",
  "(Le Marche should have what I'm looking for.)": "",
  "Hey, remember that outfit I bought you? I'd love to see you in it!": "",
  "Thanks for coming out today, Tsukino-chan. Let's hang out again sometime.": "",
  "No, thank you for taking me. I hope to see you soon!": "",
  "I know your interview's coming up soon, so would you like to get some practice in with me?": "",
  "Sure, that'd be great!": "",
  "Okay. Then I'll meet you at Theater Square, as usual.": "",
  "Great! Thank you so much!": "",
  "Tsukino-chan. We can meet up for that interview practice right now, if you want.": "",
  "Huh? Really? Thank you!": "",
  "Somehow you seemed kind of down last time. If you want, we could always go relax somewhere. Help ease the stress a bit.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "That's a secret.": "เป็นความลับ",
  "Go for it.": "ลงมือได้เลย",
  "Never.": "ไม่มีทาง",
  "Right!?": "ใช่ไหมล่ะ!?",
  "That's not true.": "ไม่จริงหรอก",
  "How'd it go?": "เป็นไงบ้าง?",
  "That's amazing!": "สุดยอดไปเลย!",
  "What? Are you serious?": "อะไรนะ? เอาจริงเหรอ?",
  "Isn't it?": "ใช่ไหมล่ะ?",
  "That's fine.": "ก็ได้",
  "Hmm.": "อืม"
 }
}
